 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg5a-00",
   "text": "重入的入口，不只是转 ETH。",
   "spoken": "虫入的入口，不只是转 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.072,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.852
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-01",
   "text": "2020 年 4 月的 imBTC，是一种 ERC-777 代币。转账时，会回调持有人注册的钩子。",
   "spoken": "2020 年 4 月的 imBTC，是一种 ERC-777 代币。转账时，会回掉持有人注册的钩子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.892,
   "dur": 8.496,
   "speechStart": 4.99,
   "speechEnd": 12.535
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-02",
   "text": "借贷协议 Lendf.Me 的存款函数，返回时用旧值写回余额，抵押记录因此虚高。",
   "spoken": "借贷协议 Lendf.Me 的存款函数，返回时用旧值写回余额，抵押记录因此虚高。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.608,
   "dur": 7.224,
   "speechStart": 13.706,
   "speechEnd": 19.991
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-03",
   "text": "攻击者借走约 2500 万美元的资产，按事发时估值。据 The Block 报道，资金后来已归还。",
   "spoken": "攻击者借走约 2500 万美元的资产，按事发时估值。据 The Block 报道，资金后来已归环。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-03.mp3",
   "start": 21.052,
   "dur": 8.112,
   "speechStart": 21.15,
   "speechEnd": 28.338
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-04",
   "text": "在 BNB Chain 上，很多项目分叉自以太坊协议。",
   "spoken": "在 BNB Chain 上，很多项目分岔自以太坊协议。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-04.mp3",
   "start": 29.384,
   "dur": 4.656,
   "speechStart": 29.482,
   "speechEnd": 33.196
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-05",
   "text": "原协议只接受白名单代币。分叉项目放开成任意代币都能上架，却没给存款函数加锁。",
   "spoken": "原协议只接受白名单代币。分岔项目放开成任意代币都能上架，却没给存款函数加锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-05.mp3",
   "start": 34.26,
   "dur": 7.896,
   "speechStart": 34.358,
   "speechEnd": 41.32
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-06",
   "text": "攻击者上架一个自己部署的代币，在转账函数里回调存款，同一笔资产被记了两次。",
   "spoken": "攻击者上架一个自己部署的代币，在转账函数里回掉存款，同一笔资产被记了两次。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-06.mp3",
   "start": 42.376,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 42.474,
   "speechEnd": 48.712
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-07",
   "text": "允许任意代币，就等于允许任意回调。上架流程本身，就是安全边界。",
   "spoken": "允许任意代币，就等于允许任意回掉。上架流程本身，就是安全边界。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-07.mp3",
   "start": 49.772,
   "dur": 7.008,
   "speechStart": 49.87,
   "speechEnd": 55.939
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-08",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月的 Penpie 也类似，损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月的 Penpie 也类似，损失约 2700 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-08.mp3",
   "start": 57.0,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 57.098,
   "speechEnd": 61.883
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-09",
   "text": "攻击者无许可创建市场，市场用了恶意代币。",
   "spoken": "攻击者无许可创建市场，市场用了恶意代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-09.mp3",
   "start": 62.956,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 63.054,
   "speechEnd": 66.387
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-10",
   "text": "批量领取奖励的函数没有锁，攻击者在回调里存入资产，把存款变成了奖励。",
   "spoken": "批亮领取奖励的函数没有锁，攻击者在回掉里存入资产，把存款变成了奖励。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-10.mp3",
   "start": 67.448,
   "dur": 6.816,
   "speechStart": 67.546,
   "speechEnd": 73.427
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-11",
   "text": "所以审计的第一步，是列出所有外部调用。代币转账、NFT 安全转账、回调、低级 call，一个都不漏。",
   "spoken": "所以审计的第一步，是列出所有外部掉用。代币转账、NFT 安全转账、回掉、低级 call，一个都不漏。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-11.mp3",
   "start": 74.484,
   "dur": 9.648,
   "speechStart": 74.582,
   "speechEnd": 83.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-12",
   "text": "然后对每一处问两句。",
   "spoken": "然后对每一处问两句。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-12.mp3",
   "start": 84.352,
   "dur": 2.448,
   "speechStart": 84.45,
   "speechEnd": 85.973
  },
  {
   "id": "seg5a-13",
   "text": "调用之前，相关状态都更新到最终值了吗？",
   "spoken": "掉用之前，相关状态都更新到最终值了吗？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep04/audio/lines/seg5a-13.mp3",
   "start": 87.02,
   "dur": 4.392,
